  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3} & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(2\\cdot -1-0\\cdot 0)i-(\\sqrt{3}\\cdot -1-0\\cdot 1)j+(\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 0-2\\cdot 1)k \\\\  & =-2i+\\sqrt{3}j-2k \\\\  & =\u27e8-2,\\sqrt{3},-2\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
